#. +> trunk5
#: ProgressView.cpp:68
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"<title>Progress</title>"
"<para>This view is used to inspect and edit task progress information for the selected project.<nl/>"
"The tasks are divided into groups dependent on the task status:"
"<list>"
"<item><emphasis>Not Started:</emphasis> Tasks that should have been started by now.</item>"
"<item><emphasis>Running:</emphasis> Tasks that has been started, but not yet finished.</item>"
"<item><emphasis>Finished:</emphasis> Tasks that where finished in this period.</item>"
"<item><emphasis>Next Period:</emphasis> Tasks that is scheduled to be started in the next period.</item>"
"</list>"
"The time period is configurable.</para>"
"<para>This view supports configuration and printing using the context menu.<nl/>"
"<link url='%1'>More...</link></para>"
msgstr ""
"<title>Progreso</title>"
"<para>Esta vista úsase para inspeccionar e editar información do progreso de tarefas para o proxecto seleccionado.<nl/>"
"As tarefas divídense en grupos que dependen do estado das tarefas:"
"<list>"
"<item><emphasis>Non se iniciou:</emphasis> Tarefas que a estas alturas xa deberían estar iniciadas.</item>"
"<item><emphasis>En execución:</emphasis> Tarefas iniciadas pero non finalizadas.</item>"
"<item><emphasis>Finalizada:</emphasis> Tarefas rematadas neste período.</item>"
"<item><emphasis>Seguinte período:</emphasis> Tarefas programadas para iniciarse no seguinte período.</item>"
"</list>"
"O período de tempo pode configurarse.</para>"
"<para>Esta vista permite configurar e imprimir co menú contextual.<nl/>"
"<link url='%1'>Máis…</link></para>"

